{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Data Science Pipeline.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Data Science Pipeline.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"data science pipeline data science pipeline","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Data Science Pipeline.md","fileName":"Data Science Pipeline.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Data Science Pipeline","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Data Ethics and Digital Power]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","AI Traceability","aiethics.epub","datascience_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Data Science Pipeline.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Data Science Pipeline.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"data science pipeline data science pipeline","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Data Science Pipeline.md","fileName":"Data Science Pipeline.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Data Science Pipeline","heading":"Data Science Pipeline","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A data science pipeline is the sequence through which data are captured, cleaned, combined, selected, restructured, modeled, interpreted, and used for action. Ethical choices occur at every stage, not only when a finished model produces a decision.\n\nCollection determines who becomes visible. Cleaning and selection decide which records count as errors or relevant evidence. Modeling chooses a target and a representation, while interpretation connects a statistical pattern to a real-world judgment. Because responsibility is distributed across this sequence, documenting transformations and decisions supports [[AI Traceability]] and makes hidden assumptions easier to challenge.\n\nThe book's CRISP-DM account makes the sequence iterative. Business understanding, data understanding, preparation, modeling, evaluation, and deployment can send work back to an earlier decision when data quality, model behavior, or practical usefulness falls short. The pipeline ends in a decision process and its monitoring, not in a model file.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","AI Traceability","aiethics.epub","datascience_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Data Science Pipeline.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Data Science Pipeline.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"data science pipeline data science pipeline","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Data Science Pipeline.md","fileName":"Data Science Pipeline.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Data Science Pipeline","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]\n\n[[datascience_mit.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","AI Traceability","aiethics.epub","datascience_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}